WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
I can die at any time

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,550
Because of the previous life

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,190
I have nothing to waste

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:09,880
You have never let down others, Nian Nian, what else?

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,880
You lie again

6
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,730
I'm sad

7
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,420
I can't imagine

8
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,940
How much hardship have you endured to become like this?

9
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,980
Such a special poison punishment

10
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,660
Such a completely different life along the way

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,300
We have experienced all kinds of life and death

12
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,660
all your efforts

13
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,620
I see it all in my eyes and remember it in my heart

14
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,980
Even if it's just a transaction

15
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,980
I know what kind of person you are

16
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,140
And you know yourself better than you do

17
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,370
whether you believe it or not

18
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,410
No matter what happens from now on

19
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:50,770
I won't even leave you

20
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:53,770
I am willing to spend my whole life for you
